{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：22:04 2026-11-11 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"警務處處長周一（中）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/27930ab969a57784420587178347ac8a/2026-11/7b45c830-6bdd-4b50-a2dd-1a72c95eb405.jpg\"/>\n<p>今夜跑馬地馬場舉行九場賽事，戲碼並無特別，卻迎來稀客。第六場賽事開跑前，警務處處長周一鳴現身馬匹亮相圈附近，身旁全是雄赳赳的外籍男子，原來「一哥」是夜入馬場，是以「東家」身份帶領來自比利時的警方代表，參觀世界聞名的香港夜間賽馬。但見周一鳴全程一馬當先，並滔滔不絕跟幾位比利時警方代表有傾有講，似解釋馬場的良好秩序，多過分析賽馬心得。比利時這次派員來港交流，是香港與比利時兩地警務交流的續篇，周一鳴曾於六月下旬，率代表團訪問比利時，參觀過安特衛普警局的多個單位，旨在加強警務工作的合作，並交流執法方面的科技應用，這次輪到對方訪港，由周一鳴作東。</p>\n<h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f8cc8ef388aba7d51f523b00be613ebc/2026-11/0e26d201-f0cc-4c11-8eb3-0b8648076b93.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/082b34e5daebf1fb7b018c1ed1ac0595/2026-11/7ad74ee6-394f-4978-915c-ba97e343e71c.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a21da0f83a8ba8779c031cbb65f1fadd/2026-11/10f408fd-c7d1-43fe-85ff-4e3393752c7c.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3b3d566ab1ca0c86c7c590b88c7fb911/2026-11/66d96a28-f894-4664-8035-35b0b899b7eb.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cdc6d9f303891cb0c367f27fcafdef21/2026-11/819e6ef0-68af-4044-8854-c342faae6541.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7204244ec0ea5249e12fff301b511c43/2026-11/290918cb-b056-4e00-9661-50720f35a387.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f9ab0012b27ad13ded8968863ea9ce3e/2026-11/bc3c6a98-a370-4628-8ce0-42363b1aafcb.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a4d3bc99735b26120aa9d7895efae492/2026-11/bfba8c7c-a4ab-4a7a-96d9-204ead01bf62.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/15d80e14c794fd0c213cd376f85af41c/2026-11/e7239ad5-8959-4074-a959-48c60daeeacc.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T14:19:20.889626+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":307,"images":10,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T14:04:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T16:55:11.905656+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T14:12:51.666929+00:00","content_hash":"a2c3c73bbd30582854260eb6542d281fa44ebd92b6af59b9f1ebefc18f099f91","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}